    "review_notes": "Text is faithful and correctly keeps \"year-round\". Blocked on the same question as the Monstera page: plant_name maps the bare genus name \"Hoya\" (200+ species) to H. carnosa. \"Wax Plant\" is carnosa-specific and fine, but \"Hoya\" alone is not, and this page lists Hoya australis as commonly confused with it. Confirm what the dataset's Hoya entry covers before approving the mapping; check overlay_plants.json alongside the Monstera entry. Also drop environment: indoor — the sentence carries no environment limit, and paragraph 3 explicitly describes summering the plant outdoors on a patio in partial shade. Locator is Description paragraph 2."
